<%# locals: (title:, updated: nil, crumbs: [], links: [], data: {}) %>
<%# THE LEGAL PAGE: the standard page header and a readable column, for an app's
    privacy policy and terms (docs/PAGE_HEADER.md, "The legal page"). Render it as a
    layout around the page's sections:

      render layout: "studio/legal_page", locals: { title: "Privacy Policy", updated: "November 8, 2026" }
        ...the sections, each an h2 and its paragraphs...

      title     the page's one h1, in studio/_page_header.
      updated   the date the text last changed, as the reader should see it. It is
                printed as "Last updated" and the date, under the row.
      crumbs    the row's trail, as studio/_page_header takes it.
      links     the row's links line, such as the other legal page.
      data      data attributes for the column, such as data-legal-page.

    SCOPED CSS, NOT UTILITIES, as studio/site_footer/_assets: the column reads the
    theme's custom properties with a fallback beside each, so it reads the same in a
    Tailwind app and in a plain-CSS one. A plain-CSS app also sets
    config.page_header_self_styled, so the row brings its own styles too.

    The column has a 1rem gutter, which the row's default bleed fits. %>
<% unless @_studio_legal_page_styled %>
<% @_studio_legal_page_styled = true %>
<style <%= tag.attributes(nonce: (content_security_policy_nonce if respond_to?(:content_security_policy_nonce))) %>>
  .legal-page { box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 46rem; margin-inline: auto; padding: 1.5rem 1rem 3rem; }
  .legal-page-updated { margin: .25rem 0 0; font-size: .875rem; line-height: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, var(--color-text-secondary, currentColor)); }
  .legal-page-body { margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-body, currentColor);
    overflow-wrap: break-word; }
  .legal-page-body > :first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .legal-page-body :is(h2, h3) { color: var(--color-text, currentColor); line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .legal-page-body h2 { margin: 2.25rem 0 0; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .legal-page-body h3 { margin: 1.5rem 0 0; font-size: 1.0625rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .legal-page-body :is(p, ul, ol) { margin: .75rem 0 0; }
  .legal-page-body :is(ul, ol) { padding-left: 1.5rem; }
  .legal-page-body ul { list-style: disc; }
  .legal-page-body ol { list-style: decimal; }
  .legal-page-body li + li { margin-top: .375rem; }
  .legal-page-body strong { color: var(--color-text, currentColor); font-weight: 700; }
  .legal-page-body a { color: var(--color-primary-ink, var(--color-primary, currentColor)); text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .legal-page-body a:hover { text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
  .legal-page-body section + section { margin-top: 0; }
</style>
<% end %>
<%= tag.div(class: "legal-page", data: { studio_legal_page: "" }.merge(data)) do %>
  <%= render "studio/page_header", title: title, crumbs: crumbs, links: links %>
  <% if updated.present? %>
    <p class="legal-page-updated">Last updated <%= updated %></p>
  <% end %>
  <article class="legal-page-body"><%= yield %></article>
<% end %>
